Sorry about that :-)

"proportional" is short for proportional spacing, and means that the spacing
between letters in proportional to the width of the letters. Ie., the spacing
after an 'i' (a narrow letter) is smaller than the spacing after an 'm'
(a wide narrow). Fixed means fixed spacing, ie., the letters are spaced at
fixed intervals, with no regard for the size of the letters.

